 "isError": false, "timestamp": 1787961645937}, {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_Ap67gDMEtftcKXY7txax49qY|fc_0853f74888369b4d016a92212d9ce087d294d46fb07794575c", "toolName": "bash", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "--- metadata filenames only ---\nmetadata/org.springframework/spring-core/5.3.15/reachability-metadata.json\nmetadata/org.springframework/spring-core/index.json\ntests/src/org.springframework/spring-core/5.3.15/src/test/resources/META-INF/native-image/reachability-metadata.json\ntests/src/org.springframework/spring-core/5.3.15/src/test/resources/META-INF/spring.factories\ntests/src/org.springframework/spring-core/5.3.15/src/test/resources/org_springframework/spring_core/class-path-resource.txt\ntests/src/org.springframework/spring-core/5.3.15/src/test/resources/org_springframework/spring_core/dynamic-access.properties\ntests/src/org.springframework/spring-core/5.3.15/src/test/resources/spring.properties\n--- changed source/resource paths ---\ntests/src/org.springframework/spring-core/5.3.15/build.gradle\ntests/src/org.springframework/spring-core/5.3.15/dynamic-access-exhaust-report.json\ntests/src/org.springframework/spring-core/5.3.15/src/test/java/org_springframework/spring_core/AbstractMergedAnnotationTest.java\ntests/src/org.springframework/spring-core/5.3.15/src/test/java/org_springframework/spring_core/AbstractRecursiveAnnotationVisitorTest.java\ntests/src/org.springframework/spring-core/5.3.15/src/test/java/org_springframework/spring_core/AddDelegateTransformerTest.java\ntests/src/org.springframework/spring-core/5.3.15/src/test/java/org_springframework/spring_core/AnnotationAttributesTest.java\ntests/src/org.springframework/spring-core/5.3.15/src/test/java/org_springframework/spring_core/AnnotationsScannerTest.java\ntests/src/org.springframework/spring-core/5.3.15/src/test/java/org_springframework/spring_core/AttributeMethodsTest.java\ntests/src/org.springframework/spring-core/5.3.15/src/test/java/org_springframework/spring_core/Auto